OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum team 'over the moon' at
OL,4,Anational award win
OL,5,
OL,6,FMuseum bosses are "over the moon" after
OL,7,Fwinning a top national award for the
OL,8,Fsecond year running.
OL,10,FJersey Museum was one of only 21
OL,11,Fattractions that won a Gold accolade at
OL,12,Fthe VisitEngland Visitor Attraction
OL,13,FAccolades.
OL,15,FLouise Downie, Jersey Heritage's
OL,16,Fdirector of curation and experience,
OL,17,Fsaid: "We are over the moon about
OL,18,Fwinning gold again for Jersey Museum."
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
