OL,3,GNEWSAMuseum team 'over the moon' at
OL,4,Anational award win
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said the award, alongside positive
OL,7,Ffeedback from visitors, confirmed
OL,8,Fimprovements at the museum were
OL,9,Fbenefiting people discovering Jersey's
OL,10,Fhistory and she highlighted the
OL,11,Fflagship exhibition La Terr'rie d'Jerri
OL,12,Fand the new interactive exhibition
OL,13,FPlaying with Light.
